  "Unbalanced brackets lost in the printed text (OCR shows ']' without '[') were restored to the evident intent.",
  "Modern-en uses Gilgamesh and Enkidu throughout (the sources print Gilgamesh/Gish and Eabani/Enkidu/Engidu); Humbaba and Huwawa follow the spelling of the source passage; this is a naming normalisation only."
