   "chapter": 7,
   "paragraph": 1,
   "source": "RO",
   "pages": "83",
   "originalWords": 28,
   "modernWords": 26,
   "note": "Rogers numbers this dream in his 'Second Tablet, col. IV'; by content it is Enkidu's dream of the netherworld (Tablet VII in current numbering). Placed here as a separate paragraph before Muss-Arnolt's netherworld lines; the two are not merged."
  },
