   "pages": "367",
   "originalWords": 87,
   "modernWords": 77,
   "note": "Muss-Arnolt p.367-368 prints these lines as a fragment of a probable 'other recension' (Haupt pls. 17-19, Jeremias). Editorial placement in Tablet VII by content (house of darkness / Enkidu's dream); the Codex v1 package excluded it. Bracket restored: [I have descended?]."
  },
